hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1839.1","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1839.2","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1840.1","Malik related to me from his paternal uncle Abu Suhayl ibn Malik from his father that Abu Hurayra said"
"1840.2","Malik related to me from his paternal uncle Abu Suhayl ibn Malik from his father that Abu Hurayra said"
